sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Consumer
  participant POS as Merchant POS
  participant A as Acceptor PSP
  participant W as Wero Context
  participant APP as Wallet / Bank App
  participant P as Consumer PSP
  participant R as SCT Inst / Rail

  POS->>A: Create payment request(amount, order)
  A-->>POS: paymentRequestId + QR context
  POS-->>C: Display QR
  C->>APP: Scan QR
  APP->>C: Display merchant + amount
  C->>APP: Approve / SCA
  APP->>P: Stable payment intent
  P->>R: Financial submission
  R-->>P: Authoritative result
  P-->>A: Payment result
  A-->>POS: Signed status / callback
  POS-->>C: Close sale only on backend status
